1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:02,154
(sighs)

2
00:00:02,151 --> 00:00:04,551
(Leonard:)Should we call Sheldon
and Howard?

3
00:00:04,553 --> 00:00:06,323
(Raj:)No. We can do this by ourselves.

4
00:00:06,322 --> 00:00:08,052
(Leonard:)Okay. Great.
How do you want to start?

5
00:00:08,057 --> 00:00:09,457
(Raj:)I don't know.
How do you want to start?

6
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:17,230
Sheldon. Sheldon.

7
00:00:17,233 --> 00:00:19,303
(Howard:)Sheldon.

8
00:00:25,873 --> 00:00:28,773
(Sheldon:)I bet that started off
as a joke,

9
00:00:28,777 --> 00:00:31,407
(Sheldon:)but by the third one
you realized

10
00:00:31,413 --> 00:00:35,083
(Sheldon:)there was something
strangely enjoyable about it.

11
00:00:35,084 --> 00:00:38,554
(Penny:)Yeah, I kind of want
to do it again.

12
00:00:38,554 --> 00:00:41,124
(Sheldon:)I don't recommend it. You'll be
doing it the rest of your life.

13
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:45,864
(Sheldon:)Anyway, if you're looking for
Leonard, he's with Koothrappali.

14
00:00:45,861 --> 00:00:47,491
(Penny:)Uh, no, I actually came
to talk to you.

15
00:00:47,496 --> 00:00:49,796
(Sheldon:)How nice.

16
00:00:51,366 --> 00:00:53,036
(Sheldon:)Here are some topics
that interest me:

17
00:00:53,035 --> 00:00:56,235
(Sheldon:)quantum mechanics,
trains, flags...
No, no.

18
00:00:56,238 --> 00:00:58,538
(Penny:)It's about my acting career.
Oh, sorry.

19
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,910
(Sheldon:)That's not on the list.

20
00:00:59,908 --> 00:01:01,578
(Howard:)Well...
Oh, wait. No.

